under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications made by Doslarb include, depending on the release:
  * removal of the vision encoder and multi-token-prediction head;
  * re-implementation of the text decoder in an independent code base;
  * a new chat template, tokenizer configuration and (optionally) additional
    Khmer vocabulary entries;
  * continued pre-training, supervised fine-tuning and preference optimisation
    on Khmer, English and Chinese data;
  * quantisation and format conversion for local inference.

